.TH SWAYDESK-PORTAL 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.2.0" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-portal \- accent color backend for xdg\-desktop\-portal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-portal
.SH DESCRIPTION
Answers org.freedesktop.appearance accent\-color for libadwaita applications through xdg\-desktop\-portal, which merges it with the gtk backend (sway\-portals.conf: Settings=swaydesktop;gtk). D\-Bus activation starts it; it tells the applications when the configuration changes and exits with Sway.
.PP
The session runs it under the name sway\-portal (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-portal); the process name is sway\-portal too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.TP
.I /usr/share/xdg\-desktop\-portal/portals/swaydesktop.portal
The portal backend entry.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7),
.BR xdg\-desktop\-portal (1)
